From ef565c691f85e4c39a84cb6e0a1cb75afb62ea5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: desocketed <desocketed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 23:46:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 31/32] NX2NAVI_TRACE=nvn: each guest thread's time per host
 function and SVC, guest code as the rest, every 600 presents (#132)

hostfn_entry and rt_svc time every call (rdtsc, exclusive of the calls inside it) into a table of the calling thread; a wait
still running at a report is booked to its innermost call. The presenting thread logs itself and the six threads with the most
guest code. Field, 25.9 ms frame: the presenting thread only waits for the main thread; the main thread spends 9.3 ms in
nvnQueueSubmitCommands (the finish wait), 7.9 ms waiting for its job workers (svc 0x34), 4.1 ms in guest code.
